<body class="worldpage bookpage">
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<header class="nav is-solid">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="mark" href="/" aria-label="KNGHT home">
      <svg viewBox="0 27 600 66" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="30" cy="60" r="16"/><path d="M46 60 H120 M120 30 V90 M136 51 L530 51 L594 60 L530 69 L136 69 Z"/></svg>
      KNGHT
    </a>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/#worlds">Worlds</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#layers">The layers</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#score">Score your world</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav__end">
      <a class="btn btn--sm" href="#pick" data-magnetic>Pick a time</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="main">
  <section class="whero book">
    <div class="wrap book__grid">
      <div class="book__intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">The Verdict Call · Free · 30 minutes</p>
        <h1 class="display book__title">Find out where you stand, <em>before</em> you spend.</h1>
        <div class="book__side">
        <p class="book__lede">Thirty minutes on the world you have and the rules it lives under. Tell us what you sell, who you sell it to, and who regulates you. We look at your site and your category live, and we tell you what we see.</p>
        <p class="book__micro">No pitch deck. No obligation. If we can't help, we'll say so.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="book__cal" id="pick">
        <div class="calendly-inline-widget" data-url="https://calendly.com/sho-knght/30min?hide_gdpr_banner=1&amp;hide_event_type_details=1&amp;hide_landing_page_details=1&amp;background_color=0a0a0a&amp;text_color=f2f2f2&amp;primary_color=ffffff" style="min-width:300px;height:760px"></div>
        <p class="book__fallback">Calendar not loading? <a class="link" href="https://calendly.com/sho-knght/30min" rel="noopener">Open it in Calendly</a> or email <a class="link" href="mailto:sho@knght.com">sho@knght.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wsec">
    <div class="wrap wsec__grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">What you leave with</p>
      <ul class="wrules" data-reveal>
        <li><b>Your three biggest risks</b><span>Named on the call. The things most likely to cost you a customer, a listing or a letter from your regulator.</span></li>
        <li><b>One fix for this week</b><span>The exact change, at no charge. Yours to keep whether we work together or not.</span></li>
        <li><b>A straight answer on fit</b><span>Either a Verdict is worth it, or it isn't yet and we tell you what to do first.</span></li>
        <li><b>A fixed quote</b><span>If a Verdict makes sense: from $3,500 CAD, a scored report in 5 business days from kickoff, and the fee credited to your Build within 60 days.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wsec">
    <div class="wrap wsec__grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">What we cover</p>
      <ol class="chapters">
        <li class="chapter" data-reveal><span class="chapter__n">1</span><h3>Your business</h3><p>What you sell, who buys it, and the one result you need this year.</p></li>
        <li class="chapter" data-reveal><span class="chapter__n">2</span><h3>Your rules</h3><p>Your regulator and what your marketing has to pass: CPSO, CNO, the Law Society, AGCO, CFIA or Health Canada.</p></li>
        <li class="chapter" data-reveal><span class="chapter__n">3</span><h3>A live look</h3><p>Your site, your search presence and one piece of marketing you are proud of, on screen together.</p></li>
        <li class="chapter" data-reveal><span class="chapter__n">4</span><h3>The seven layers</h3><p>Where your world is likely holding, and where it is likely leaking.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wsec">
    <div class="wrap wsec__grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">Before the call</p>
      <div class="wsec__text" data-reveal>
        <p>Have your website address ready, plus one ad, label, menu or form you use today. That is all.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wsec">
    <div class="wrap wsec__grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">Questions</p>
      <div class="faq">
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary>How much does a Verdict cost?</summary>
          <p>From $3,500 CAD, as a fixed fee quoted before we start. The figure depends on how many locations and products your world covers. You know it before you commit.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary>How long does it take?</summary>
          <p>A scored report in 5 business days from your kickoff call. The clock starts once we have your site, your marketing and access to what we need to read.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary>What does the Verdict cover?</summary>
          <p>All seven layers: Lore, Law, Language, Map, Ground, Artifacts and Machinery. Each is scored against your buyer and your regulator, with an AI readiness check: which work could run itself, and what is safe to automate. You get a ranked fix list with the order to do it in.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary>Who does the work?</summary>
          <p>Sergio Ho, KNGHT&#x27;s founder, leads every Verdict and every call.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary>What happens if I go ahead with a Build?</summary>
          <p>The full Verdict fee is credited to a Build that starts within 60 days, so you never pay twice for the same thinking.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary>Is the call free?</summary>
          <p>Yes. Thirty minutes, no obligation. You leave with your three biggest risks and one fix you can make this week.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary>Which businesses do you work with?</summary>
          <p>Ontario clinics, medspas, law firms, spirits, coffee and food brands, and other businesses where the rules shape what the marketing can say.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wcta">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="display" data-split>Thirty minutes. <br>One <em class="sheen">Verdict.</em></h2>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn" href="#pick" data-magnetic>Pick a time
          <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 18 10" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 5h16M12 1l4 4-4 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a class="link" href="/#score">Score your world first</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="footer__base"><span>&copy; <span data-year>2026</span> KNGHT, Toronto.</span><span><a href="mailto:sho@knght.com">sho@knght.com</a> · <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a> · <a href="/accessibility/">Accessibility</a></span></div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script is:inline>
/* Carry the self-check result into Calendly's first question, if one exists. */
(function () {
  var q = new URLSearchParams(location.search), el = document.querySelector('.calendly-inline-widget');
  if (!el || !q.get('score')) return;
  var note = 'Self-check: ' + q.get('score') + '/70' + (q.get('weak') ? '. Weakest layer: ' + q.get('weak') + '.' : '.');
  el.setAttribute('data-url', el.getAttribute('data-url') + '&a1=' + encodeURIComponent(note));
}());
</script>
<script is:inline src="https://assets.calendly.com/assets/external/widget.js" async></script>
<Motion />
<script is:inline src="/assets/js/vendor/lenis.min.js" defer></script>
<script is:inline src="/assets/js/site.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
